Real-World Examples

| Type                      | Real-World Example                                                      |
| ------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Two Agents**            | Customer Support Agent + FAQ Agent                                      |
| **Two Agent + RAG**       | PDF Chatbot, Medical Document Assistant                                 |
| **Sequential Chat Agent** | Bus Search → Seat Check → Ticket Booking                                |
| **Joint Chat Agent**      | AI Research Assistant with multiple experts                             |
| **Group Chat Agent**      | Software Development Team (Manager + Coder + Tester + Reviewer)         |
| **Hierarchical Agent**    | Enterprise AI with Manager Agent controlling multiple department agents |


